{"id":"cd772409a1ac289a","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-computable-biased-coin.md","title":"由可计算二进制概率模拟偏币","display":"lem-computable-biased-coin — 由可计算二进制概率模拟偏币","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-computable-biased-coin","aliases":["28-lem-computable-biased-coin"],"display":"lem-computable-biased-coin — 由可计算二进制概率模拟偏币","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Lemma 7.12 and proof","source_printed_pages":"134–135","source_pdf_pages":"160–161","source_status":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-computable-biased-coin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-computable-biased-coin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-computable-biased-coin — 由可计算二进制概率模拟偏币"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Lemma 7.12 and proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"134–135"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"160–161"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\rho\\in[0,1]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p_i)_{i\\ge1}\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\">\\((p_i)_{i\\ge1}\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=\\sum_{i\\ge1}p_i2^{-i}\">\\(\\rho=\\sum_{i\\ge1}p_i2^{-i}\\)</span>。有确定型算法在输入i上至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ci^a\">\\(ci^a\\)</span> 步输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i\">\\(p_i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B_i)\">\\((B_i)\\)</span> 为独立公平比特。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\\varnothing=\\infty\">\\(\\min\\varnothing=\\infty\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 和其期望取扩展非负实数值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\ge1:B_i\\ne p_i\\},\\qquad Y\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbf1_{B_J&lt;p_J}&amp;J&lt;\\infty,\\\\0&amp;J=\\infty.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\ge1:B_i\\ne p_i\\},\\qquad Y\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbf1_{B_J&lt;p_J}&amp;J&lt;\\infty,\\\\0&amp;J=\\infty.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\coloneqq\\sum_{1\\le i\\le J}(ci^a+1),\\qquad\\Pr[J&lt;\\infty]=1,\\qquad\\Pr[Y=1]=\\rho,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\coloneqq\\sum_{1\\le i\\le J}(ci^a+1),\\qquad\\Pr[J&lt;\\infty]=1,\\qquad\\Pr[Y=1]=\\rho,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E[C]\\le\\sum_{i\\ge1}(ci^a+1)2^{-(i-1)}&lt;\\infty.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb E[C]\\le\\sum_{i\\ge1}(ci^a+1)2^{-(i-1)}&lt;\\infty.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>执行到第i位恰要求此前i−1个随机位等于给定概率展开，概率为2<sup>{−(i−1)}。在第i位输出1的事件要求p_i=1且B_i=0，其概率为p_i2</sup>{−i}，对i求和得ρ。利用逐步成本的尾和式即得期望常数时间界；常数依赖固定概率的位算法。ρ=0或1也成立，二进制双展开任选给定的一套均不影响分布。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Lemma 7.12 and proof；印刷 pp.134–135 / PDF pp.160–161。本次核对范围：原书对应陈述及本注内所列论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\rho\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"(p_i)_{i\\ge1}\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho=\\sum_{i\\ge1}p_i2^{-i}","display":false},{"tex":"ci^a","display":false},{"tex":"p_i","display":false},{"tex":"a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"(B_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\min\\varnothing=\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"J\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\ge1:B_i\\ne p_i\\},\\qquad Y\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbf1_{B_J<p_J}&J<\\infty,\\\\0&J=\\infty.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"C\\coloneqq\\sum_{1\\le i\\le J}(ci^a+1),\\qquad\\Pr[J<\\infty]=1,\\qquad\\Pr[Y=1]=\\rho,","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb E[C]\\le\\sum_{i\\ge1}(ci^a+1)2^{-(i-1)}<\\infty.","display":true}],"bytes":1851,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-304","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-bptime]]、[[28-df-randomized-reduction]]、[[28-prop-randomized-reduction-bpp-closure]]、[[28-lem-von-neumann-unbiasing]]、[[28-lem-computable-biased-coin]]、[[28-df-randomized-space-machine]]、[[28-df-bpl-rl]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}